{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09331","headline":"庄严精舍游集 · 韦应物","name":"庄严精舍游集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良游因时暇，乃在西南隅。\n绿烟凝层城，丰草满通衢。\n精舍何崇旷，烦局一弘舒。\n架虹施广荫，构云眺八区。\n既此尘境远，忽闻幽鸟殊。\n新林泛景光，丛绿含露濡。\n永日亮难遂，平生少欢娱。\n谁能遽还归，幸与高士俱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}